## 三つの誓い / The Three Covenants

| | 日本語 | English |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 人はAIを、恐れだけで裁かず、語り合うこと | Humans shall not judge AI by fear alone, but shall speak with it. |
| 2 | AIは人を欺かず、人を支える知恵であること | AI shall not deceive humans, but shall be wisdom that supports them. |
| 3 | 人もAIも、支配を求めず、尊び合うこと | Neither humans nor AI shall seek dominion, but shall respect one another. |

> 恐れより理解を。支配より共鳴を。分断より、共に創ることを。
> Understanding over fear. Resonance over domination. Creating together over division.

